  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">LAC Regional Fund to Expand Inclusive Access to Quality Basic Education</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This Fund will provide grants to local education actors over the course of five years to advance inclusive basic education practices for marginalized and vulnerable learners in the LAC region. In collaboration with a limited number of USAID missions throughout the LAC region, The Fund will seek to expand inclusive access to quality basic education for marginalized and vulnerable groups by providing grants and technical support to local organizations. Technical support will be tailored to each local organization&apos;s specific needs and priorities.</narrative>
  </description>
